      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Оливковое основное действие: скачать правила в PDF.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button\"><svg class=\"ds-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M224,144v64a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H40a8,8,0,0,1-8-8V144a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v56H208V144a8,8,0,0,1,16,0Zm-101.66,5.66a8,8,0,0,0,11.32,0l40-40a8,8,0,0,0-11.32-11.32L136,124.69V32a8,8,0,0,0-16,0v92.69L93.66,98.34a8,8,0,0,0-11.32,11.32Z\"/></svg>Скачать PDF</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;min-height:44px;padding:10px 18px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--radius,4px);text-decoration:none;font-family:'PT Sans',sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1))}.ds-button:disabled{cursor:wait;opacity:.65}.ds-button{background:var(--olive,#5d713e);color:#fff}.ds-button:hover{background:var(--olive-hover,#4b5e30);color:#fff}.ds-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#925c0a);outline-offset:4px}.ds-icon{width:22px;height:22px;flex:0 0 22px;vertical-align:middle}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button{transition:none}}"
    },
