      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button\">Тест брони Д12</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;min-height:44px;padding:10px 18px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--radius,4px);text-decoration:none;font-family:'PT Sans',sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1))}.ds-button:disabled{cursor:wait;opacity:.65}.ds-button{background:transparent;color:var(--forest,#30483b);border-color:var(--line,#b8bca9)}.ds-button:hover{background:var(--sidebar,#e9ebdd)}.ds-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#925c0a);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Поиск в шапке",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input-search",
      "description": "Светлое поле поиска на лесной поверхности с кнопкой и подсказкой клавиатуры.",
      "html": "<form class=\"ds-search-surface\" role=\"search\"><div class=\"ds-search\"><button type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Найти правило\"><svg class=\"ds-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M229.66,218.34l-50.07-50.06a88.11,88.11,0,1,0-11.31,11.31l50.06,50.07a8,8,0,0,0,11.32-11.32ZM40,112a72,72,0,1,1,72,72A72.08,72.08,0,0,1,40,112Z\"/></svg></button><input type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Найти правило…\" aria-label=\"Поиск по правилам\"><kbd aria-hidden=\"true\">Ctrl K</kbd></div></form>",
      "css": ".ds-search-surface{padding:16px;background:var(--forest,#30483b)}.ds-search{position:relative;max-width:440px;color:var(--ink,#252c27)}.ds-search input{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:46px;border:1px solid #c4c8b7;border-radius:var(--radius,4px);padding:10px 68px 10px 42px;background:var(--paper,#f5f3ea);color:var(--ink,#252c27);font-family:'PT Sans',sans-serif;font-size:16px;caret-color:var(--forest,#30483b)}.ds-search input::placeholder{color:#606554;opacity:1}.ds-search button{position:absolute;left:4px;top:3px;width:38px;height:40px;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#596052);display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer}.ds-search kbd{position:absolute;right:10px;top:11px;font:12px \"PT Sans\",sans-serif;color:#535b4d;border:1px solid #a9af9a;border-radius:3px;padding:2px 4px}.ds-search :focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--paper,#f5f3ea);outline-offset:4px;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--forest-dark,#21372c)}.ds-icon{width:22px;height:22px;flex:0 0 22px;vertical-align:middle}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Навигация глав",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "chapter-nav-active",
      "description": "Нумерованные строки; активная глава имеет лесную заливку и светлое жирное начертание.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-chapters\" aria-label=\"Главы правил\"><a href=\"#movement\"><span>05</span>Передвижение</a><a href=\"#damage\" aria-current=\"page\"><span>06</span>Учёт повреждений и тесты</a><a href=\"#shooting\"><span>07</span>Стрельба</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-chapters{background:var(--sidebar,#e9ebdd);padding:18px 0;font-family:'PT Sans',sans-serif;}.ds-chapters a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin:0 8px;padding:16px 14px;min-height:56px;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink,#252c27);font-size:16px;line-height:1.3;border-bottom:1px solid #cdd0bf}.ds-chapters a span{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:15px;min-width:22px}.ds-chapters a:hover{background:#dfe3d1}.ds-chapters a[aria-current=page]{background:var(--forest,#30483b);color:#fff;font-weight:700;border-color:var(--forest,#30483b);border-radius:var(--radius,4px);margin-top:-1px}.ds-chapters a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#925c0a);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
